<title>AUSTRALIA: Hoyts close to UK cinema deal announcement.</title>
<headline>Hoyts close to UK cinema deal announcement.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hoyts Cinemas Ltd said on Wednesday it is close to making an annoucement on a cinema development project at the Bluewater retail complex in Kent southern England.</p>
<p>&quot;We have secured Bluewater and there will be further announcements on that,&quot; Hoyts chief executive officer Peter Ivany told reporters from a conference call in London.</p>
<p>But Ivany would not provide any further details.</p>
<p>Australian media have reported Hoyts would construct a 20 screen cinema complex at Bluewater. Bluewater is being developed by Lend Lease Corp Ltd which is a Hoyts shareholder.</p>
